# Local environment files. These carry OIDC client secrets and per-developer
# settings, so nothing matching .env* is committed -- except the checked-in
# template, which must stay free of real credentials.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash so these only match at the repo root: `ui/.env`
# is a tracked build setting (CHOKIDAR_USEPOLLING) and must not be caught here.
/.env
/.env.*
!/.env.example
